title: "On-device live captioning and translation benchmarks for in-person events"
abstract: "Open benchmark data and scoring scripts comparing word accuracy and caption delay of on-device speech recognition and translation for live events, tested on real-time audio. Maintained by ConferenceCaptioning.com. Data is licensed CC BY 4.0, scoring code MIT."
